    "summary": "scripts/daemon-ctl.sh gains one forced-stop function, called by cmd_stop and by the stale-daemon branch of cmd_start: after the wait it kills the pid only when its command line ends in daemon/index.js, removes the pid file and socket, and logs the 'killed' line; a live pid that is not a daemon is left alone and the script exits 4 naming it. The wait is overridable through INSRC_CTL_STOP_WAIT_SECS. A killed process not yet collected by its parent counts as gone.",
